Official references checked live: https://katex.org/docs/options confirms output html/htmlAndMathml, mutable macro environment, size cap and expansion limit; https://katex.org/docs/api confirms renderToString produces HTML strings; https://katex.org/docs/node, /security and /browser remain available and relevant. This does not verify NEPL3 adapter behavior or resource-error classification for an adopted KaTeX package.

